<title>NETHERLANDS: TENNIS-WORLD INDOOR TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WORLD INDOOR TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results on the second day of the $750,000 men's Rotterdam World Indoor tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Jason van Herck (Belgium) beat Arnoud Boetch (France) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Martin Sinner (Germany) beat 6-Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>David Prinosil (Germany) beat Karol Kucera (Slovakia) 6-2 2-6 6-3</p>
<p>3-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) beat Bohdan Ulihrach (Czech Republic) 7-5 6-7 (4-7) 6-2</p>
<p>2-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) beat Martin Damm (Czech Republic) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Daniel Vacek (Czech Republic) beat 4-Jan Siemerink (Netherlands) 7-6 (7-3) 7-6 (7-2)</p>
</text>
